         'better hardware or increase their net operational profit margins.</p>\n'
         '</section>\n'
         '\n'
         '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
         '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">4. Step-by-Step Installation via SSH '
