         '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">5. System Memory Tuning and MySQL '
         'Optimization</h2>\n'
         '  <p class="text-gray-600">Optimizing core Linux kernel parameters provides instant responsiveness on budget '
