         '\n'
         '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
         '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">1. Virtualize Bare Metal Servers to Leverage Cloud '
         'VPS Tiers</h2>\n'
         '  <p>The most immediate cost discrepancy in the cPanel licensing catalog lies between <strong>Cloud '
         '(VPS)</strong> and <strong>Metal (Dedicated)</strong> tiers. A bare-metal dedicated license carries a steep '
         'base premium because the cPanel licensing daemon detects unvirtualized physical hardware on boot.</p>\n'
         '  <p>If you operate physical servers in data centers such as OVH, Hetzner, or Leaseweb, do not install '
         'cPanel directly onto raw AlmaLinux or Ubuntu metal. Instead, install a type-1 hypervisor such as Proxmox VE '
         'or utilize <a href="/virtualizor-license" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold '
         'hover:underline">Virtualizor</a> to slice the hardware into high-capacity virtual machines. Running cPanel '
         'inside a KVM guest qualifies your server for cPanel Cloud VPS licensing, instantly shaving dozens of dollars '
         'off your monthly bill per physical node.</p>\n'
