         'server licensing overhead in 2026.</figcaption>\n'
         '  </figure>\n'
         '</section>\n'
         '\n'
         '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
         '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. Switch to Wholesale Automated IP Licensing with '
         'LicenBase</h2>\n'
         '  <p>Purchasing individual licenses at retail rates through traditional hosting distributors forces you to '
