                'Softaculous Premium over manual installation workflows.</figcaption>\n'
                '  </figure>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Why 1-Click Staging and Automated Backups '
                'Matter</h2>\n'
