                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Wholesale Pricing: Is Softaculous Worth '
                'It?</h2>\n'
                '  <p>When purchased through retail channels, a Softaculous VPS license costs approximately $20 to $24 '
                "annually. However, through LicenBase's automated wholesale platform, you can acquire an authentic <a "
                'href="/softaculous-license" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Softaculous '
