                '  </figure>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Resource Efficiency: Low RAM Footprint on '
                'Cheap VPS</h2>\n'
                '  <p>The primary technical reason administrators choose DirectAdmin is its remarkable efficiency. '
                'Unlike other panels that run background Java or heavy Perl daemon processes, DirectAdmin is written '
                'entirely in compiled C++.</p>\n'
                '  <p>Technical benefits on budget VPS hardware include:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                "    <li><strong>Minimal Memory Overhead:</strong> DirectAdmin's core processes consume less than 150 "
                'MB of RAM at idle, leaving virtually all server memory available for PHP-FPM, Redis, and MySQL '
                'buffers.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Runs on 1 GB VPS:</strong> You can reliably operate a DirectAdmin server on a '
                '$3/month cloud instance with 1 vCPU and 1 GB of RAM without triggering Linux Out-Of-Memory (OOM) '
