                'tool that compiles web server components directly from source, allowing you to choose between Apache, '
                'Nginx, LiteSpeed, or reverse-proxy combinations with zero third-party dependencies.</li>\n'
                "    <li><strong>Automated SSL Integration:</strong> Free Let's Encrypt certificates are issued and "
                'renewed automatically via built-in cron routines without requiring external certbot daemons.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">DirectAdmin vs cPanel: Which Should You '
