                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Deployment and Migration Best '
                'Practices</h2>\n'
                '  <p>If you choose to run DirectAdmin, we recommend pairing it with AlmaLinux 9 or Debian 12. Use the '
