                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">CloudLinux OS</a>.</p>\n'
                '  <p>By connecting WHMCS to LicenBase via automated API hooks:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li>When a client configures a VPS order and enters their server IP, WHMCS calls the LicenBase '
                'API upon payment.</li>\n'
                "    <li>The license is issued and activated on the client's IPv4 address within 30 seconds "
