                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Tactic 1: Adopt the BYOL (Bring Your Own '
                'License) Model</h2>\n'
                '  <p>The single most impactful cost reduction technique is separating your compute provider from your '
