                'any individual website from crashing the entire server node.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p>This allows you to host 3x to 5x more active client websites on the exact same server instance '
                'without performance degradation. Server density is the secret metric that distinguishes profitable '
                'hosting operations from struggling ones.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Tactic 3: Leverage Combo Discounts and '
                'Unified Portals</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Managing licenses across multiple disparate vendors wastes administrative time and often results '
                'in paying full retail setup fees. LicenBase provides unified billing across all major server '
